      "body": "The Birch project asks for release notes in German. Source-code identifiers remain English.",
      "project": "birch"
    },
    {
      "id": "backend",
      "title": "Rowan persistence backend",
      "body": "Rowan persists authoritative records in PostgreSQL. Redis is only a disposable cache.",
      "project": "rowan"
    },
    {
      "id": "batch-size",
